=00_AQD74CMfXjMjUXN3ciIqwa_ixCWBuix7qRinFnWo2B4GJg&oe=6A4E5C42"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GNaIY808v1EQ7kNvwG3fa1r&_nc_oc=AdqHUfcOdz8b2whHGHYkInmD1wAr5o5qmissmJXw7XLjTxIWjdCoiesXkncvx1aVtUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDmyFcn5fdoAVp1T23rgTkXq_V7uk5MTmIkLn89dSG1Pw&oe=6A4E51BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YIEgGeH8SdMQ7kNvwHt4ey2&_nc_oc=Ado-qK9MSbcn5RvqXw2oRRvoq0ETsQPAy9dsvMO9Q0sIPbbOuwrWd1y_vCdBwSmKvD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA82lY5hTJU7cQp2HMQb8DFgsZNl63aH7ysDq5Espk8rA&oe=6A4E60B0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quick reflexes to survive.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest, Afterlife: Dead Zone delivers an immersive experience where you can only move physically within your designated play area, plunging you into a dark, destructive, and oppressive world.", "short_descr